e2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHooray! A strike! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tWell done, Sal! If I were you, I would be jumping up and down!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tOk! I will! ... Ouch, my back! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tWhat happened? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tI threw out my back! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tYou'd better sit down!", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le03ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tI think I may have pulled a muscle ... <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tI'd get that checked out if I were you. It could be serious. My Aunt Nelly threw her back out and was laid up for weeks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tFor weeks! Maybe I ought to go home and lie down.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tMe, too. Wow, we are quite the pair ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tThis reminds me of our trip to the Grand Canyon. We shouldn't try any more sports together. Someone always gets injured.", "time": "22000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le03ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tNo kidding! Ok, we'd better get moving. We ought to go home and relax.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tIf ... If we went home, we'd need to have some movies to watch while we heal.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tGood idea! I think I have a few we could watch.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tGreat, let's get going. Come on, V. Lean on me and I'll lean on you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tOw, I have shooting pain going up my leg. Ouch!", "time": "48000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le03ob06re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title